<title>TUNISIA: TUNISIA'S BNDT H1 PROFIT FALLS.</title>
<headline>TUNISIA'S BNDT H1 PROFIT FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Banque Nationale de Developpement Touristique (BNDT) said on Friday that pretax net profits fell by 62.9 percent during the first half of 1997 to 1.277 million dinars from 3.444 million dinars during the same period last year, results showed on Friday.</p>
<p>The state-controlled bank specialises in loans for the tourism sector.</p>
<p>BNDT share was last priced 8.0 dinars at the Tunis Stock Exchange. ($=1.166 dinar)</p>
